;=============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW
; MODULE 05R -- PRODUCTION REGISTRY
;=============================================================
;
; Complete Byzantine production-domain registry.
; Goals 400-424 are reserved for this production authority.
; Goals 500-503 are the four-goal engine cost vector.
;
; 400 infantry             militia-line
; 401 anti-cavalry         spearman-line
; 402 ranged               archer-line
; 403 anti-ranged          skirmisher-line
; 404 light cavalry        scout-line
; 405 heavy cavalry        knight-line
; 406 mobile ranged        cavalry-archer-line
; 407 unique cavalry       cataphract-line
; 408 ram siege             battering-ram-line
; 409 area siege            mangonel-line
; 410 anti-mass siege       scorpion-line
; 411 gunpowder siege       bombard-cannon
; 412 castle siege          trebuchet-set
; 413 monastery             monk-set
; 414 galley navy            galley-line
; 415 fire navy              fire-ship-line
; 416 demolition navy       demolition-ship-line
; 417 imperial navy         dromon
; 418 production state
; 419 escrow state
; 420 site state
; 421 admission domain
; 422 pass lock
; 423 reassessment flag
; 424 petard / structure assault
;
